he same  old 4.7 inch LCD display and a very  dated home button and making everything  even worse MKBHD just released his best  smartphone camera of 2022 video and  something really important stood out to  me during the night mode portion of the  test out of all 16 phones that he tested  which all came out this year the iPhone  SE was by far the worst at night mode  because it's the only phone out of all  of them that doesn't actually have night  mode and if you're wondering why that is  it's not because of the chip since this  comes with the same a15 bionic chip  that's in the new iPhone 14. so why does  it not have night mode well the truth is  that that Apple intentionally left that  feature out to make the more expensive  models seem better and then adding even  more to the pain they raised the price  of the iPhone SE to 429 dollars so right  now potential buyers have the choice of  either spending 429 on an outdated SE or  600 for an iPhone 12 which is better in  literally every single way it gets Max  safe it gets rid of the home button it  gets much better cameras a much larger  OLED display better speakers better  battery life and more and believe it or  not I recently needed to buy a budget  iPhone for business use for one of my  employees so she can take phone calls  and guess what I bought an iPhone for  460 dollars and it wasn't the SE yes I  bought a fully unlocked iPhone 12 on  Amazon for 460 dollars just 30 bucks  more than the SE now I know no it's not  brand new but it's got Amazon's renewed  premium guarantee which has a few  important benefits most importantly it  comes with a one year satisfaction  guarantee so if you're not happy with it  you can return it within that one year  it's also guaranteed to have over 90  battery capacity as well as minimal  cosmetic damage which is not noticeable  when the device is held at arm's length  and on top of that it comes with a brand  new mfi charging cable and charger in  the box which ironically doesn't come  with a new iPhone SE from Apple or any  other new iPhone so to be completely  honest with a deal like that readily  available on Amazon you'd have to be  crazy to buy an outdated iPhone SE  especially heading into 2023 and one of  the main reasons I chose an iPhone 12  instead is that it has face ID which is  honestly the best form of authentication  ever put into a smartphone and that's  where the iPhone se4 was supposed to  come in it's rumored to have a design  that's basically identical to the iPhone  10r with a notch face ID and of course  removal of the home button now all of  that sounds nice but here's the big  issue it's supposed to be coming out in  2024 and by that time the entire iPhone  lineup will have already gotten rid of  the notch completely and switched over  to the dynamic Island design which is  happening next year with the iPhone 15  lineup so the Dilemma for apple is that  switching to the newer iPhone 10r design  is likely going to make it more  expensive but who in their right mind  would be buying a phone with a notch in  2024 and on top of that Apple would  likely have to withhold other features  like macsafe which of course wasn't  present in the iPhone 10r anyway and  that is the issue issue right there the  iPhone SC was originally supposed to be  a throwback to a smaller classier design  for those who didn't like the larger  iPhone 6 design but now everyone's  gotten used to larger phones and just  this year the 14 pro Max was actually  the best selling model out of the entire  lineup so basically the iPhone SC has  now become something totally different  it uses an outdated design that no one  really likes anymore and the feature set  is Cherry Picked by Apple to  intentionally hold back important  features so that the SE doesn't  cannibalize the sales of the higher end  models that basically makes the task of  creating a successful iPhone SE model  almost impossible since apple is trying  to make it worse on purpose and that  never works it's why I think the current  iPhone SE is a bad phone they kept the  design exactly the same again again  which was a huge disappointment and big  mistake in my opinion so for the iPhone  se4 it's going to be incredibly hard to  balance in terms of keeping the price as  low as possible without butchering the  features and value of the phone like  they did with the current iPhone SE  which is a terrible purchase right now  when you can simply buy a renewed iPhone  12 with the latest design right now for  just a bit more cash and honestly by the  time the iPhone se4 comes out the new 15  and 15 Pro Models are going to be coming  out with an even newer design which I  imagine could look something like these  renders and that of course will make the  SE design look even older so with that  said I believe that if Apple chooses to  delay the iPhone se4 I think it makes  more sense just to cancel it all  together or perhaps make it exclusive to  certain countries like India and others  where it makes sense to have a lower  priced iPhone but if you complete  greatly disagree with my thoughts in  this video then let me know down in the  comment section below and if you want to  see which iPhone I personally recommend  you buy right now check it out using the  YouTube product tagging feature and  click the circle above to subscribe for  more videos like this one thanks for  watching and we'll see you in the next  video
 

